        </div>
        <div class="q-row">
          <span class="q-label"><span class="q-sub">The various health benefits for society resulting from the use of the soap</span></span>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">18</strong><select class="sel-input" name="practice_single_reading_44_18" id="practice_single_reading_44_18_" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 18"><option value="">— A–F —</option><option value="A">A</option><option value="B">B</option><option value="C">C</option><option value="D">D</option><option value="E">E</option><option value="F">F</option></select></span>
        </div>
        <div class="q-row">
          <span class="q-label"><span class="q-sub">The original business goal of the Lever brothers</span></span>
          <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">19</strong><select class="sel-input" name="practice_single_reading_44_19" id="practice_single_reading_44_19_" autocomplete="off" aria-label="Question 19"><option value="">— A–F —</option><option value="A">A</option><option value="B">B</option><option value="C">C</option><option value="D">D</option><option value="E">E</option><option value="F">F</option></select></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="q-section-hdr">
        <h3>Questions 20–26</h3>
        <p>Complete the notes below.<br>Choose <b>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS</b> from the passage for each answer.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="notes-subhdr">Sunlight Soap: Key Facts</div>

      <div class="notes-lead">● Founders</div>
      <ul class="notes-list">
        <li> William Hesketh Lever and <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">20</strong><input type="text" class="sc-input" id="practice_single_reading_44_20_" autocomplete="off" name="practice_single_reading_44_20" aria-label="Question 20" placeholder="Answer"></span></li>
