      </ul>

      <div class="notes-lead">● Key product innovation</div>
      <ul class="notes-list">
        <li> Used <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">22</strong><input type="text" class="sc-input" id="practice_single_reading_44_22_" autocomplete="off" name="practice_single_reading_44_22" aria-label="Question 22" placeholder="Answer"></span> and alkali instead of animal fats and wood ash</li>
        <li> Resulted in a product that was more consistent, superior and <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">23</strong><input type="text" class="sc-input" id="practice_single_reading_44_23_" autocomplete="off" name="practice_single_reading_44_23" aria-label="Question 23" placeholder="Answer"></span></li>
      </ul>

      <div class="notes-lead">● Marketing &amp; branding</div>
      <ul class="notes-list">
        <li> Advertisements focused on purity and fighting <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">24</strong><input type="text" class="sc-input" id="practice_single_reading_44_24_" autocomplete="off" name="practice_single_reading_44_24" aria-label="Question 24" placeholder="Answer"></span></li>
      </ul>

      <div class="notes-lead">● Worker welfare</div>
      <ul class="notes-list">
        <li> Built a model village called <span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">25</strong><input type="text" class="sc-input" id="practice_single_reading_44_25_" autocomplete="off" name="practice_single_reading_44_25" aria-label="Question 25" placeholder="Answer"></span></li>
        <li> Based on the philosophy of "<span class="ielts-listening-question-item"><strong class="ielts-listening-question-number">26</strong><input type="text" class="sc-input" id="practice_single_reading_44_26_" autocomplete="off" name="practice_single_reading_44_26" aria-label="Question 26" placeholder="Answer"></span>"</li>
